            "review_title": "Review at Pho Bac Hai",
            "review_text": "SL Y\n673 contributions\n0\nAverage to poor pho\nJan 2023 • Couples\nCame here because of good reviews..... But sadly not up to expectations! Can't understand how they got so many good reviews. Actually the reviews are quite extreme....reviews state either the best or the worst. Seating outside. Probably should have tried the place opposite. They got our order wrong. Our dish of green vegetables didn't even get to our table. They forgot my beer. So we only ended up with 2 bowls of their beef pho. Not very good. Average. They even forgot to give us beansprouts, so had to chase them. Couldnt bother to wait any more for the beer or the vegatables. So asked for the bill. Paid VND120k for the 2 bowls of beef pho. Still felt hungry so crossed over to the place opposite and saw that their simialr beef pho was VND35k compared to VND60k here. This place is priced higher compared to opposite place\nRead more\nWritten January 5, 2023",
